## Record Header

Every Verification Record must contain the following header fields.

- `record_type` — must be `verification_record`
- `version` — format version
- `artifact` — identifier of the verified artifact
- `artifact_sha256` — SHA256 digest of the artifact
- `checks` — results of verification modules
- `decision` — PASS or FAIL
- `timestamp` — verification time in UTC ISO-8601


{
  "record_type": "verification_record",
  "version": "1.0",

  "artifact": "artifact.txt",
  "artifact_sha256": "27dd98b932f7873e026a9612ee691636c9aa6b7077319d1888462b6e7325da4b",

  "checks": {
    "signature": "PASS",
    "identity_state": "PASS",
    "license_policy": "PASS"
  },

  "decision": "PASS",

  "timestamp": "2026-03-13T00:00:00Z"
}
